{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46911","headline":"沙鸥 · 齐己","name":"沙鸥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暖傍渔船睡不惊，可怜孤洁似华亭。\n晚来湾浦冲平碧，晴过汀洲拂浅青。\n翡翠静中修羽翼，鸳鸯闲处事仪形。\n何如飞入汉宫里，留与兴亡作典经。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}